Spoiler:

     Well, you need a potion of confusion (or some other way to get confused),
and a scroll of teleportation.  Reading this scroll when confused teleports up/
down levels, and with a ring of teleport control, you can teleport down to, say,
level 35 (hell).  Be sure to have a ring of fire resistance on, too...


